ow \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x+ky=-3 \\\\  & (2k+7)y=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is consistent dependent if it has infinitely many solutions. For the system to have infinitely many solutions, it must have at least one free variable.\n\nIf $k=-\\frac{7}{2},$ then the second equation is $0=0,$ which is true for any value of $y$, and we can remove this equation from the system. As a result, the system will contain only one equation, $x+ky=-3.$ \n\nThen, the basic variable will be $x,$ and we will have a free variable $y.$ That means the system will have infinitely many solutions.\n\nTherefore, our system is consistent dependent when $k=-\\frac{7}{2}.$" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317595 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317596 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317597 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317598 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317599 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1041 "selection" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317598 13194139534888 true] [17592186317594 1110 #uuid "01c086ee-bd59-5116-96cd-3ea346830057" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317595 1034 "k=-\\frac{2}{7}" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317595 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534888 true] [17592186317595 1111 #uuid "2bfe9ef6-dcef-5d1c-89ab-085d758feff3" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317596 1034 "k=\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317596 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534888 true] [17592186317596 1111 #uuid "4a162357-d3eb-5b79-a136-8f7482a4d4a7" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317597 1034 "k=-7" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317597 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534888 true] [17592186317597 1111 #uuid "8d98839c-b0ac-51c1-aa1e-3f5c9668efe6" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317598 1034 "k=-\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139534888 true] [17592186317598 1103 #